# XNU patches for this board and profile.
#
# Both are compatibility fixes for building xnu-8796 with a current Xcode clang,
# not behaviour changes. They are device-local copies because the shared
# arch/soc/os series targets xnu-10063; these two hunks apply unchanged to
# xnu-8796's sources.

# make_symbol_aliasing.sh looks availability.pl up under ${SDKROOT} in
# xnu-8796. The build driver already installs that file into its fakeroot and
# exports XNU_AVAILABILITY_PL, but only xnu-10063's generator honours the
# variable. Without this the installhdrs pass dies with
# "Unable to locate ....sdk//usr/local/libexec/availability.pl".
local-availability.patch

# makedefs/MakeInc.def passes
# -enable-trivial-auto-var-init-zero-knowing-it-will-be-removed-from-clang,
# the acknowledgement flag Apple's clang needed while the feature was
# experimental. Current clang rejects it as an unknown argument, which fails
# every C and C++ compile. -ftrivial-auto-var-init=zero remains, so the
# behaviour is unchanged.
drop-trivial-auto-var-init-acknowledgement.patch
